# Mobile App (`@my-barber/mobile`)

## Structure

```
src/atoms/      → Button, Text, Input, Icon (primitives)
src/molecules/  → BarberCard, ServiceRow, SlotChip
src/organisms/  → BookingForm, SlotGrid, DateStrip
src/templates/  → ScreenLayout
src/screens/    → full client screens (LoginScreen, HomeScreen, …)
src/lib/        → api, auth, query, i18n, format, slots, storage
app/            → Expo Router routes (thin re-exports or inline barber screens)
tests/          → render-utils, fixtures, api-mocks, setup
```

- Client routes: thin re-export from `src/screens/`: `export { LoginScreen as default } from '../../src/screens/LoginScreen'`
- Root layout (`app/_layout.tsx`) owns providers, auth hydration, role-based redirects.

## Components

- Named exports: `export const Button: React.FC<ButtonProps>` with explicit prop interfaces.
- Theme from `@my-barber/ui`; Restyle primitives via `src/lib/restyle.ts` (`Box`, `ThemedText`, `AppTheme`).
- Do not import `@shopify/restyle` directly in components — use `AppTheme` from `../lib/restyle`.
- Domain types from `@my-barber/types`; wire shapes as `Api*` in `src/lib/api.ts` when needed.
- Wrap screens in `ScreenLayout`. Add `accessibilityRole`, `accessibilityLabel`, `testID` on interactive elements.
- File header comments describe purpose and OD design reference.

## State & data

| Concern | Tool |
|---------|------|
| Server state | TanStack React Query (`queryKeys`, `STALE` presets in `src/lib/query.ts`) |
| Auth/session | Zustand `useAuthStore` + `expo-secure-store` |
| Local UI | `useState` / `useMemo` in screens or organisms |

- No React Context, no `src/hooks/` folder yet.
- API: axios in `src/lib/api.ts` — interceptors inject JWT, 401 clears session.
- Response shape: `{ ok: true, data: T }` — unwrap with `r.data.data`.
- i18n: i18next, locales `uz` (default) + `ru`, namespace `common`. Use `t('auth.signInTitle')`.

## Imports

- **No path aliases** — relative imports only.
- Order: React/RN → third-party → `@my-barber/*` → local relative.

## Tests

- Jest + `@testing-library/react-native`; render via `renderWithProviders` from `tests/render-utils.tsx`.
- Fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`; API mocks in `tests/api-mocks.ts`.
- Mirror source tree under `src/__tests__/`.
